      "widgets_values": [
        "# MODELS AND NODES USED IN THIS WORKFLOW  \n\n---\n\n### I used this Easy Installer for Portable ComfyUI from [HERE](https://github.com/Tavris1/ComfyUI-Easy-Install) after installing that you run the Nunchaku bat file from Addons folder.\n\n---\n\n## 🟣 Nunchaku Qwen-Image DiT Loader\n\n## ⚠️ For Nvidia 40 series and lower, use INT4 models.\n## ⚠️ For the 50 series, use FP4 models.\n\n### Download **svdq-int4_r128-qwen-image-edit-2509-lightningv2.0-4steps** from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/nunchaku-tech/nunchaku-qwen-image-edit-2509/resolve/main/svdq-int4_r128-qwen-image-edit-2509-lightningv2.0-4steps.safetensors?download=true) \n\n### Or a different version from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/nunchaku-tech/nunchaku-qwen-image-edit-2509/tree/main) depending on your video card\n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models` \n\n---\n\n## 🟣 Load CLIP\n\n###  Download **qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors** from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors) or a bigger model from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/tree/main/split_files/text_encoders)\n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/clip`  \n\n---\n\n## 🟣 Load VAE\n\n### Download **qwen_image_vae.safetensors** vae model from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors)  \n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/vae`  \n\n---\n\n## 🧩 Nodes Installed from Manager  \n\n- **rgthree-comfy**\n- **ComfyUI-nunchaku**\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Resources  \n🎥 **Tutorials:** [Pixaroma YouTube Channel](https://www.youtube.com/@pixaroma)  \n💬 **Community Discord:** [Join Here](https://discord.com/invite/gggpkVgBf3)\n\nLearn more about Nunchaku Node from [HERE](https://github.com/nunchaku-tech/ComfyUI-nunchaku)\n"
      ],
